            "Alibaba's release says the Zhenwu V900 from its T-Head unit \"delivers three times the performance of its predecessor, the Zhenwu M890 (released in May)\", featuring \"216 GB of GPU memory and 1,200 GB/s of inter-chip bandwidth\" with native FP8 and FP4 support, and is \"scheduled for mass production and commercial release in Q1 2027\".",
