          "bullets": [
            "CNBC reports AMD stock surged 10% on Monday to an intraday high of $615.52, \"which boosted the company's value just above $1 trillion\" for the first time. The stock is on a five-day winning streak, up about 25% over that stretch and more than 180% this year.",
