            "This follows Anthropic's own frontier-safety proposals the previous week. OpenAI's RSS lists the underlying post at 10:00 GMT on 21 September, about 100 minutes before this edition's window opens; the post itself returned HTTP 403 to both fetchers, so every quotation above is CNBC's rendering of it, not text we read on OpenAI's site."
