            "Xiaomi's accompanying technical report, dated 21 September 2026 on alphaXiv, states MiMo-V2.6-Pro's DeepSWE v1.1 average@3 rose from 58.4 to 72.6 and the Flash variant from 48.7 to 65.7, with a distilled 9B model going from 61.1 to 66.2 on SWE-bench Verified and an internal cybersecurity mini-benchmark from 31.3 to 47.0.",
